<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>CPP-API: Abstract interface for log stream implementations. </para>



<para>Several default implementations are provided, see <link linkend="_types_8h_1ae4271f61a7c06cd4770fc3e11f58f9c6">aiDefaultLogStream</link> for more details. Writing your own implementation of <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_log_stream">LogStream</link> is just necessary if these are not enough for your purpose. </para>
</section>
